# {{title}}

Static web page, plain HTML/CSS/JS, no framework and no build step.

- Must work when opened from `file://`: relative paths only, no modules that need a server, no network requests unless the user asks.
- Formatting is automatic after each edit (Prettier for HTML, Biome for CSS/JS); fix what the linters and typos report.
- Keep it accessible: semantic HTML, alt text on images, readable at 360 px wide, works in light and dark mode.
- Ask before adding a framework, bundler or npm dependency.
